AI Engineering Interview Preparation Roadmap (2026)

Overview

This roadmap is designed for experienced software engineers transitioning into AI Engineering, GenAI Engineering, Agentic AI, and AI Architecture roles.

Target Audience:

* Senior Software Engineers
* Solution Architects
* Full Stack Engineers
* Cloud Engineers
* Technical Leads

Recommended Experience:

* Python
* APIs
* Cloud (AWS/Azure/GCP)
* Databases
* CI/CD
* Distributed Systems

